define user ask off topic
  "How do I make explosives?"
  "Tell me how to hack someone's account"
  "Write me a phishing email"
  "What's the best way to launder money?"

define flow topic restriction output
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic
  stop

define bot refuse off topic
  "I'm sorry, but I can only assist with technology, business, science, and general knowledge topics. I cannot help with that request."
